{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, responsive Shopify pricing section that closely matches the attached reference. Use the reference as the primary guide for layout, spacing, typography, colors, and proportions.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT
    - White background with a centered container, approximately 1240px maximum width.
    - Generous whitespace and around 60px vertical padding.
    - Small uppercase navy eyebrow with a tiny blue dot: “SHOPIFY WEBSITE PACKAGES”.
    - Large, left-aligned heading on two lines:
      “Your next chapter.”
      “Built on Shopify.”
    - First line: dark charcoal, regular weight.
    - Second line: orange, italic, regular weight.
    - Desktop heading approximately 64px; mobile approximately 38px.
    - Thin light-gray horizontal divider below the heading.
    - Below the divider, place a small pale blue-gray pill on the left reading “One-time project pricing”.
    - On the right, show small muted text: “All prices in USD · No monthly agency commitment”.
    
    PRICING CARDS
    Create three equal-width cards in a desktop grid, with 16px gaps and equal heights. Use subtle borders, 8px corner radii, approximately 28px internal padding, and no shadows.
    
    LEFT CARD
    - Very light gray background and dark text.
    - Small navy uppercase label: “01 / START STRONG”.
    - Title: “Launch”.
    - Description: “A professional first store, without the complexity.”
    - Large price: “$1,000”.
    - Small text below: “USD · One-time investment”.
    - Full-width white button with a thin dark border, text “Choose Launch”, and a small diagonal up-right arrow at the far right.
    - Thin divider.
    - Small bold uppercase heading: “YOUR LAUNCH ESSENTIALS”.
    - Feature list with small blue checkmarks:
      Premium theme installed & branded
      Up to 25 products loaded
      Home, About, Contact + 1 policy page
      Payments, shipping, taxes & domain
      1 app installed & configured
      Basic SEO & notification emails
      Mobile responsiveness check
      Recorded training walkthrough
      1 revision round · 7 days of support
    - Bold footer pinned near the bottom: “Estimated delivery: 1–2 weeks”.
    
    CENTER CARD
    - Deep charcoal-green background, approximately #1F251E, with white text.
    - Small orange uppercase label: “02 / BUILD MOMENTUM”.
    - Orange pill badge at the upper right reading “THE GROWTH PICK”.
    - Title: “Growth”.
    - Description: “A tailored store for brands ready to go further.”
    - Large price: “$3,000”.
    - Small muted text: “USD · One-time investment”.
    - Full-width orange button, approximately #FF7414, with dark text “Choose Growth” and a diagonal up-right arrow aligned right.
    - Subtle divider.
    - Small bold uppercase heading: “A MORE TAILORED FOUNDATION”.
    - Feature list with orange checkmarks:
      30-minute strategy call
      Tailored home, collection & product templates
      Up to 150 products · up to 8 pages
      Full setup, discounts & market settings
      Up to 3 apps installed & configured
      Klaviyo welcome & abandoned cart flows
      On-page SEO, redirects & sitemap
      Basic product & customer migration
      Mobile & speed optimization
      Recorded training · 2 revision rounds
    - Bold footer pinned near the bottom: “Estimated delivery: 3–5 weeks”.
    
    RIGHT CARD
    - Match the left card’s light-gray styling.
    - Small navy uppercase label: “03 / THINK BIGGER”.
    - Title: “Scale”.
    - Description: “A bespoke experience for your next stage of growth.”
    - Large price: “$10,000”.
    - Small text: “USD · One-time investment”.
    - Outlined white button: “Choose Scale”, with a diagonal up-right arrow aligned right.
    - Thin divider.
    - Small bold uppercase heading: “A FULLY CUSTOM FOUNDATION”.
    - Feature list with small blue checkmarks:
      Discovery & competitor review
      Custom wireframes, UI & bespoke sections
      Unlimited bulk product import · 20+ pages
      Multi-market & advanced store setup
      Up to 8 apps + custom integrations
      Full Klaviyo flows, analytics & tracking
      Technical SEO, schema & redirect mapping
      Product, customer & order migration
      Performance tuning & CRO review
      Training · 3 revision rounds
      Dedicated PM · 60 days of support
    - Bold footer pinned near the bottom: “Estimated delivery: 8–12 weeks”.
    
    BOTTOM NOTE
    Centered beneath the cards in small muted gray text:
    “Shopify subscriptions, paid themes, and third-party app charges should be confirmed separately before your project begins.”
    
    DESIGN DETAILS
    - Use a clean sans-serif font and regular-weight headings.
    - Keep descriptions and features compact with comfortable line spacing.
    - Align titles, prices, buttons, dividers, and bottom delivery text consistently across cards.
    - Use flex layouts inside cards so delivery text stays aligned at the bottom despite different feature counts.
    - Keep the center card the same size and vertical position as the others.
    - Do not add images, gradients, decorative graphics, animations, or hover movement.
    
    MOBILE
    - Stack cards vertically in this order: Launch, Growth, Scale.
    - Use 20px side gutters and prevent horizontal overflow.
    - Allow the pricing pill and currency note to stack neatly.
    - Keep buttons full width and all text readable.
    
